<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<app version="@VERSION@">
	<name>MAME4Wii@SUFFIX@</name>
	<coder>MAMEdev Team, MAME4Wii contributors</coder>
	<version>@VERSION@ (MAME @MAMEVER@)</version>
	<release_date>@DATE@</release_date>
	<short_description>Arcade emulation (@GROUP@)</short_description>
	<long_description>MAME @MAMEVER@ for the Nintendo Wii.

Put ROM sets (zip/7z) in sd:/mame4wii/roms or usb:/mame4wii/roms.
Controls: Wii Remote (sideways), Wii Remote + Nunchuk, Classic Controller, Wii U Pro Controller, GameCube controllers (including the Wii U adapter), USB keyboard and mouse.
HOME opens the MAME menu; Minus+Plus opens the on-screen keyboard.</long_description>
	<no_ios_reload/>
	<ahb_access/>
</app>
